and both are fitted with collars.  The collars have receiver/transmitters
on specific frequencies.  If any partner gets x distance away from the
other both are knocked unconscious by a strong electric discarge from the
collar.  The guards also wear master collars (does not shock them of
course!) such that if any prisoner gets too far from the guards, they are
knocked out.  Guards also have a master switch that will take out ALL of
them at once.  Guard also wears a panic button (hidden, besides the
obvious switch), and wears pulse and brainwave monitoring accoutrements
that will take out all prisoners with a DRUG in addition to electro-shock
if anything happens to the guard.  No con knows who their partner is.  All
collars are assigned each day randomly, and all have throwaway covers so
that no ID'ing marks can be placed on them.  Any tampering with the cover
will set off the collar.  Brain research should also let us monitor for
signs of extreme agitation and fear, such that if a con takes a hostage
their own exitement will get the shocked to oblivion.

15) WHEN it is demonstrated that cryogenic freezing is reversible, special
laws will apply.  Anyone who ALREADY HAS a cryogenic "subscription"/
"membership", or insurance policy for same, or otherwise ALREADY has made
arrangements for freezing, must not lose this coverage under any
circumstances. This may sound odd; I will explain.  Excepting in cases of
death or life-no-chance-of-parole sentences, such convicts will have their
policies paid (if not already paid in full) by the govt.  The reasoning is
this:  These people have opted for life-extension.  To deny them this
coverage (and actual freezing should they die in prison), would be in
effect to give them a death sentence.  I am sure if you think about it you
can see the logic in this.  Given ways of reducing prison costs (and there
are MANY), and implementing them, the cost of the policy maintenance is
already covered.  BUT: even better yet, all convicts are to be PAID for
their work, and the govt. makes up the difference only (a certain
mandatory percentage must go into the cryo fund, if the cons opt for
continued coverage)!  As for this payment (this should actually be filed
above, as it should apply long before cryo is proven effective), many
prisons already do this.  I'd think 1/10 min. wage would be sufficient, if
not less since prison is an all-expenses paid vacation in hell.  An added
bonus is that prisoners are given incentive to be productive and
efficient, and are granted some self-respect and a sense that even as
prisoners they are valued as people. 

I cannot stress enough that I feel prisoners MUST be treated as people not
subhuman dogs.  In extreme cases of murder and rape, etc., I think it's
moot.  Such people belong in psych wards, not prisons.  They are NOT
reformed no matter what in most cases, and they ruin many chances for
reform in others (often by killing them if nothing else).

This coverage must also extend to people killed in the process of
apprehension, accidental shooting, etc, at any time from the time the
arrest is attempted util they get out of prison (or are found innocent).
Note that in the 1st 2 cases, freezing must be done immediately, until it
can be determined if the person had a cryo policy or not.

16) On a related note, all prisoners must not be denied medical treatment and
proper diet.  This MUST include voluntary medication and diet, not just
that required by a doctor's opinion.  You got it: people who have chosen
dietary and supplementary life extension and cognitive enhancement must
not be denied these substances.  If prisons can procure coffee, cigarettes
and other drugs for inmates it can get useful stuff as well. Note again
that the govt [us] only covers the balance left over after cons spend a
mandated quota of their hard labor earnings on their supplies.  Nor must
cons be denied access to research materials, within reason (as education
is to be added to the "curriculum" of prison, this should be no big deal.)

17) All prisons are to have a computer room (with suitably reinforced
equipment of course) with access to the net.  By this time, I fully
expect that Internet will have become a FANTASTIC research and
communication medium.  Cons with scholarly interests can further them, and
those of lesser calibre can still interact with people, and learn thereby.
Such sessions will of course be closely monitored. >:)

18) all court cases, from high treason to traffic violations, may be
juried by peers if the defendant so desires, and ALL must, regardless of
defendant's position, have a tech jury.

19) The judge must wear a suit and tie or other appropriate dress as per
culture.  All mumbo jumbo is to be stripped from court room proceedings,
including psychological weapons like black robes, and out dated garbage
like wigs and swearing on the bible.  No one is to do the "whole truth..."
bit.  It is 100% meaningless, since it is HOPED that they will tell the
truth, but generally EXPECTED that they will lie their asses off.  Simply
inform them that lying on the witness stand is perjury and is a punishable
offense.  I don't have to swear on the bible when I get a drivers license,
and I understand that running red lights is against the law.

20) belief in and reliance on eyewitness testimony is to be stripped from
judicial proceedings.  It may be considered, but it is never again to be
taken as reliable with out concrete scientific proof.

21) Defendants may opt for "prejudicial immunity", such that they may be
placed behind a screen and may have their voice "scrambled" so that no
indications of race or gender are evident to the jury.  NO indication of
race, gender, religion, sexual preference etc. may be shown to anyone
involved in the case including the judge and jury (though not the
attorneys of course).  The defendant is to be referred to at all times as
"X", and the media are not to be told who's trial it is until AFTERWARD. 
Any attemp to reveal the identity of the defendant will be considered an
attempt to sabotage the new Defendant Protection Program, and punishable
as a criminal offense. If any procribed info about the defendant is
released accidentally or otherwise during trial or appeals, the
proceedings will be ruled a mistrial.

22) NO tolerance will be show to monkeywrenching.  If an attorney pulls a
stunt like "and the defendant failed a polygraph test...whoops that's not
admissable as evidence sorry, disregard that", they will be recommended
for disbarment, and the case will be ruled a mistrial.

23) Reliance on the excremental architecture of case law precedent will be
played down, and emphasis put on the constitutional.

24) to be ABSOLUTELY eliminated: plea bargaining, and reduced sentences/
non-prosection for snitches.  Paying witnesses by one side or the other
will also be eliminated though the court should pay them and the jurors
twice their standard wage or better.

25) All jurors, as well as the defendant and plaintiff if any, must attend
a short but detailed class on law and (our new) legal procedures.  No
bullshit, just the facts.

26) needless laws must be eliminated.  This includes most traffic laws
(ESPECIALLY having to wait for green light if no one is coming, parking
meter feeding, and highway speed limits.  If anyone cares to debate the
merits of this with me, I'd be happy to.), gun laws, morality laws of any
sort, and any victimless "crimes" of any sort whatsoever, among others.
Most importantly THE DRUG WAR MUST END.  All of that mess must be
decriminalized immediately.  The DW does NOT stop crime it GENERATES it in
mindboggling proportions, and the expense is burying us.  (if anyone cares
to debate THAT I will be happy to present you a case that I am 100%
certain you will not be able to refute.)

27) COPS MUST BE HELD ACCOUNTABLE.  This hardly needs elaboration.  This
current situation is purely untenable.

28) Cops must be subjected to regular and random drug, IQ, and
psychological testing.

29) these rules must apply to ALL courts, including military ones.  The
kangaroo courts of the armed force must be replaced with a fair and
ethical system.

30) Isn't that enough?

FUNDING:  It is my VERY firm belief that a legal system of this sort will
GREATLY speed up trial time and thus costs, besides a very large array of
other patently obvious benefits.  Given this, the court system will speed
up, load will decrease (especially in light of the costs imposed for
wrongful accusations and suits), immediate appeals will be practical, and
cases where the govt is made to pay will be already covered by the savings.
 
Legislature: I will not go into this much, but some basics:

ALL legislative committees, report making efforts, and other activities
that could result in the suggestion, alteration, proposal, or
passing/rejecting of law MUST be conducted with the aid of a technical
advisory board (selected like a jury by a random method, though within
APPROPRIATE fields.)  There will also be an all-congress "Supreme
Scientific Advisory Board" (by analogy with Sup. Ct.) who may reject the
selection of any particular member of any tech board. This SSAB is
likewise randomly selected, and must vary its entire membership VERY
regularly.   As with jurors, tech advisors are to be well paid.  I am
quite confident that if employment leave is mandated by law as it is for
jurors, that most would jump at the chance to serve on such an advisory board.

The findings and rulings of the tech board on any particular issue or
legislative event must overrule the findings of the lay congresspeople. An
exception is the actual vote to pass or reject a bill, in which case the
findings of the board would be included with the bill for consideration by
the president. [The extremist in me would not even go for that much power
of congress...]

These tech boards may ONLY consider, debate upon, and report on the
validity of scientific reasoning and methodology that the congressional
committee, report makers, floor debators, etc demonstrate, and may
interrupt and make recommendations to stick with facts, not bullshit, at
any time they deem necessary.  This will serve as a superb check and
balance, while leaving the ethical and [blech!] moral, political,
economic, etc debate entirely to the lobbyists and "representatives". 

ALL govt positions that are voted on (and many that are currently not,
such as the cabinet, heads of agencies, etc.) are to be elected by a
DIRECT popular vote.  The electoral college is to be finally abolished.
If you have doubts about the possiblilty or practicality of this
suggestion I will be QUITE happy to debate it with you.  >:)

Congress persons are to serve ONE year sentences, may serve only 2
consective terms, and may NOT be re-elected more than 3 times.
This will rid us of the incumbent problem, and of career politicians. 
Congress would be far far more likely to consist of interested, competent,
and sincere citizens, as it should be, once the pork fat is drained as it
were.

Congress may NOT EVER EVER EVER again give itself pay raises. 

[I'd also suggest VERY strict guidelines on campaign funding, advertising,
debating and promises, but I haven't worked that all out yet.]

All congresscritters must undergo IQ and psych tests before taking office.
And drug testing.  They can do it to us, we'll do it to them. These tests
are to be repeated at a RANDOM time at least 3x in the year. No warning.

Required ages for senators and executive branch honchos is to be lowered.

Senility detection tests must be given to all govt. employees over 45.
Ronald Reagan should never have happened.

No more rule by the senile thank you.

